<title>FRANCE: French Matif volume figures back to normal.</title>
<headline>French Matif volume figures back to normal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Posting of Matif volume trade volume levels is back to normal after technical problems in the morning, the futures exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
